WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Your husband, Hugh,
he's an actor.

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.635 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys met working together
-We did.

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, you have not worked
together since.

00:00:04.637 --> 00:00:06.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now, he's in this season
of "Homeland."

00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:07.273 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:07.273 --> 00:00:08.742 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You guys are not doing scenes
together.

00:00:08.742 --> 00:00:10.577 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No.
Which is a good thing.

00:00:10.577 --> 00:00:11.244 size:75% position:38% line:92%
-It is a good thing.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:14.481 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I think my focus would have
been broken, finally.

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:16.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, that's what it would
have taken.

00:00:16.616 --> 00:00:20.820
But no. And he plays a prett
slime-buckety politician guy

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:23.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
-Which I enjoyed.

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.424 line:92%
But no, but it was really sweet.

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.359 align:start size:94% position:6%
It was fun to visit him
on his set

00:00:26.359 --> 00:00:28.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
and share the show with hi
in that way,

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:29.362 align:start size:94% position:6%
from the inside out.
-That's nice.

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:32.799 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it was great.
It felt very symbolically

00:00:32.799 --> 00:00:34.300 line:92%
kind of sweet and rich and nice.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:36.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
-One of the nice things
about this show as well is -

00:00:36.436 --> 00:00:37.971 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, I think in the pas
when we've seen

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:42.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
sort of female spies or female
in the intelligence agency

00:00:42.575 --> 00:00:44.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's been a lot more
acrobatic

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:47.647 align:start size:94% position:6%
and maybe a little bit mor
unrealistic...

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:48.148 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:48.148 --> 00:00:49.282 align:start size:94% position:6%
-...than "Homeland" has
chosen to be.

00:00:49.282 --> 00:00:52.685
-No, I mean, I wasn't aske
to do too many ninja moves

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:54.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Which was good.

00:00:54.654 --> 00:00:56.656 line:92%
I mean, I slept with -- people

00:00:56.656 --> 00:00:58.291 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, um...
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:00:58.291 --> 00:01:00.360 size:81% position:41%
-But I did it in dowdy
pantsuits, you know?

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:02.062 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that's true.
-You know, none of this, like,

00:01:02.062 --> 00:01:05.432
cool heels and karate chops, no.
-Yeah.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:08.802 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But no, it's true.
I think we made an effort

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:12.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
to reflect something
like reality.

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:13.606 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
And then, you've been --

00:01:13.606 --> 00:01:16.009
is it true that over the years
you've been approached by people

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:17.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
who have claimed at least
to you that

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.946 size:88% position:44%
this was the inspiration
for them pursuing maybe

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:20.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
a career
in the intelligence field?

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.482 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, a little bit.
Well, when I first started

00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:24.851 size:88% position:44%
researching this world,
and was taken to Langley

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:29.556 align:start size:94% position:6%
and was interviewing peopl
who do this job,

00:01:29.556 --> 00:01:31.324 align:start size:94% position:6%
they were
incredibly forthright,

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.726
which I found a little confusing
and confounding.

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:36.896 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I asked them, "Why are you
telling me all this?"

00:01:36.896 --> 00:01:38.731 line:92%
And they said, "Well, you know

00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
this is a powerful
recruitment tool.

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:44.237 line:92%
And we are always recruiting."

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:45.772 line:92%
And turns out, it was effectiv

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
because people do stop me
on the street

00:01:47.107 --> 00:01:50.009
and say, "Oh, my daughter is
studying Arabic in college."

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wow.
-Yeah. Like, it works.

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:55.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's a sign that
a show has succeeded,

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
eight years is a sign
it succeeded,

00:01:57.183 --> 00:01:58.151 line:92%
and also, congratulations.

00:01:58.151 --> 00:02:00.720
I heard that you found out there
was an adult film parody

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:02.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
of "Homeland."
-Um, yeah.

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.691 size:84% position:42%
-Wow, congratulations.
-Well, yeah, thank you.

00:02:04.691 --> 00:02:05.758 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah, no.

00:02:05.758 --> 00:02:08.128 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I thought
"Mad" magazine was cool.

00:02:08.128 --> 00:02:10.663 align:start size:94% position:6%
"SNL" was cool.
But like a porn?

00:02:10.663 --> 00:02:12.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
You've made it.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:14.400 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know your work has
resonance.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.870 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, yeah, so.

00:02:16.870 --> 00:02:18.204 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What was it called?
Do you remember?

00:02:18.204 --> 00:02:19.439 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know.
I don't know.

00:02:19.439 --> 00:02:21.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I don't think it was
very impressive.

00:02:21.241 --> 00:02:22.408 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it wasn't like
a good --

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:24.611 align:start size:94% position:6%
It wasn't like "Boneland"?
-No!

00:02:24.611 --> 00:02:25.445 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-No!

00:02:25.445 --> 00:02:27.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Right? I mean, that --

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:28.982 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We needed you!
-We needed -- yeah.

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:31.784 align:start size:94% position:6%
I know --
I haven't watched it,

00:02:31.784 --> 00:02:32.886 line:92%
but I do hear in that one,

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:35.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
Cookie Monster does say
"diaphragm."

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.389 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:37.624 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I should hope so.
-Yeah.

00:02:37.624 --> 00:02:38.958 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, thank you so much for
being here.

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:40.093 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thank you so much for
having me.

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.327
-Congrats on eight years.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:41.327 --> 00:02:43.663 size:88% position:44%
Really nice to see you.
Claire Danes, everybody.

